LAYERS DESCRIPTION:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LAYER ID 3 -> DECORATION 16 (subdivided to grid 4x4 per CELL)
LAYER ID 2 -> DECORATION 64
LAYER ID 1 -> OBSATCLE
LAYER ID 0 -> ROAD/GROUND


ITEM TYPE DESCRIPTION:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-assign to layer by item type / Z align method

  ROAD      -> LAYER 0 | Z = 0      + offset defined in position
  GROUND    -> LAYER 0 | Z = 0      + offset defined in position
  OBSTACLE  -> LAYER 1 | Z = auto   + offset defined in position (when auto align is disabled)
  DECOR64   -> LAYER 2 | Z = auto   + offset defined in position (when auto align is disabled)
  DECOR16   -> LAYER 3 | Z = auto   + offset defined in position (when auto align is disabled)


EVENT DESCRIPTION:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - when missing then no event is used
  
START     - used for START ITEM
AUTOZ     - is used to auto Z align for LAYER ID 1 - 3
DRVR      -  item for RIGHT driving definition
DRVL      -  item for LEFT driving definition
HERRING  - item is used/exported as HEARRING
  
[EXAMPLES]
  
{
     type     :DECOR16
     event		: SHERRING
     name     :S-HERRING
     imageiso :iso_silvercoin.png
     image    :silvercoin.png
     model    :track-editor/3d.ac
     position :0,0,0
     rotation :0,0,0
}   
{
	type			: DECOR16
	event			: DRVL
	name		 	: ROAD_DRVL
	imageiso  : flag_drvl.png
	image  		: flag_drvl.png
	model			: none
	position	: 0,0,0
	rotation	: 0,0,0
  drvl_A    : x,y,z
  drvl_B    : x,y,z
  drvr_A    : x,y,z
  drvr_B    : x,y,z	
}

{
	type			: ROAD
	name		 	: shop10_1
	imageiso  : iso_shop10.png
	image     : shop10_1.png
	model			: track-editor/shop10.ac
	position	: 0,0,0
	rotation	: 270,0,0
}
  
  
MODEL DRV POINTS definition:

   drvl_B                              drvr_B
           X ---------------------- X
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        |
           |                        | 
           X ---------------------- X  
   drvl_A                             drvr_A
   
   
   

   
